    "scientific_verdict": "Across composite moduli q in {6, 8, 9, 12, 15} and all proper divisors g | q, each g-divisible DCP difference d = g d' induces exact (q/g)-periodicity in the secret s and folded-kernel visibility invariance lambda_d(K_eta) = lambda_{d'}(K_eta^{(q/g)}). The divisor strata have sizes phi(q/g) with visibility sums given by Ramanujan's sum sum_e K_eta(e) c_{q/g}(e), and the folded kernel purity equals (g/q) sum_{k=0}^{q/g-1} lambda_{k g}(K_eta)^2 >= ||K_eta||_2^2."
  },
  "theorems": [
    {
      "id": "T1",
      "name": "Exact Coset Periodicity and Folded Visibility Identity",
      "statement": "For any difference d in {1, ..., q-1} with g = gcd(d, q), m = q/g, and d' = d/g, rho_d((s + k*m) mod q; K_eta) = rho_d(s; K_eta) for all k in {0, ..., g-1}, and lambda_d(K_eta) = lambda_(d')(K_eta^(m)) where K_eta^(m)(e_bar) = sum_(k=0)^(g-1) K_eta(e_bar + k*m)."
    },
    {
      "id": "T2",
      "name": "Exact Divisor-Stratum Cardinality and Ramanujan-Sum Visibility Total",
      "statement": "The divisor strata D_g(q) = {d in {1, ..., q-1} : gcd(d, q) = g} have cardinality |D_g(q)| = phi(q/g) summing to q - 1, and sum_(d in D_g(q)) lambda_d(K_eta) = sum_(e=0)^(q-1) K_eta(e) c_(q/g)(e) where c_m(e) is Ramanujan's sum."
    },
    {
      "id": "T3",
      "name": "Subgroup Parseval Identity and Monotone Purity Under Folding",
      "statement": "For every divisor g | q with m = q/g, the folded kernel purity satisfies ||K_eta^(m)||_2^2 = sum_(e_bar=0)^(m-1) K_eta^(m)(e_bar)^2 = (g/q) * sum_(k=0)^(m-1) lambda_(k*g)(K_eta)^2 >= ||K_eta||_2^2."
    }
  ],
  "title": "DCP Cyclic-Subgroup Quotient-Aliasing Audit: g-Fold Coset Indistinguishability, Euler-Ramanujan Divisor-Stratum Sum, and Folded-Kernel Parseval Identity"
